              "value": "(auditory, aura, emotion, fear, illusion, mental, occult)\n\n60 feet. The betobeto-san's footsteps seem to draw ever closer, yet the source remains difficult to pinpoint. Each creature that starts its turn within 60 feet of the betobeto-san must attempt a 29 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n- **Success:** The creature becomes frightened 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature becomes frightened 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature becomes frightened 4."
